  "sourceTitle": "New Zealand Lamb Chops",
  "sourceText": "New Zealand Lamb Chops\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 31, 2009 - 11:44pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 teaspoons oil\n4 shoulder lamb chops\nSalt\nPepper\n1/2 teaspoon rosemary\n3 teaspoons chopped onion\n1 teaspoon chopped mint\n1 teaspoon lemon juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Slowly heat oil in crockpot. Add chops; brown on both sides. Add remaining ingredients with 1/4 cup water. Simmer, cover 40 minutes or until chops are tender. Serves 4.",
  "parsedSource": {
    "ingredients": [
